ic","group":"mode","name":"Double harmonic (Byzantine)","tag":"B♭ double harmonic (Byzantine)","en":"Two augmented seconds: ritual fire, the East.","ru":"Две увеличенные секунды: ритуальный огонь, восток.","title":"Double Harmonic (Byzantine)"},{"slug":"mode-harmonic-major","group":"mode","name":"Harmonic major","tag":"D♭ harmonic major","en":"Major with a lowered sixth: a haunting bright breath.","ru":"Мажор с пониженной шестой: тревожное светлое дыхание.","title":"Harmonic Major"},{"slug":"orchestral","group":"found","name":"Orchestral","tag":"orchestral","en":"orchestr* is an orchestral arrangement: whatever instrument the word stands before, YuE2 builds a whole orchestra around it and loses the instrument (asked for orchestral crash cymbals, it played the orchestra). His probes probe60-orchestral, made again at full length on their seeds.","ru":"orchestr* — это оркестровое построение: перед каким бы инструментом ни стояло слово, YuE2 выстраивает вокруг него весь оркестр и теряет сам инструмент (на просьбу об оркестровых тарелках сыграл оркестр). Его пробы probe60-orchestral, перегенерённые в полную длину на тех же сидах.","title":"Orchestral"},{"slug":"cicadas","group":"found","name":"Summer cicadas","tag":"soft ambient music with loud cicadas","en":"Asked for cicadas, YuE2 plays a whole summer ambient: the dry shimmering buzz over soft music.","ru":"На просьбу о цикадах YuE2 играет целый летний эмбиент: сухой мерцающий стрёкот над мягкой музыкой.","title":"Summer Cicadas"}]};
+  var DATA = {"families":{"strings-plucked":"plucked strings","strings-bowed":"bowed strings","keys":"keys","winds-wood":"woodwinds","winds-brass":"brass and horns","winds-reed":"reeds and bagpipes","perc-drum":"drums","perc-tuned":"tuned percussion","perc-small":"small percussion","synth":"synths and electronics","voice":"voice-like","ensemble":"ensembles","other":"other"},"instruments":[{"slug":"duduk","family":"winds-reed","family_name":"reeds and bagpipes","home":"Armenia","tag":"duduk","en":"Apricot-wood double reed: a warm, nasal, mournful voice, often over a drone.","ru":"Абрикосовая дудка с двойной тростью: тёплый, носовой, скорбный голос, часто над бурдоном.","title":"Duduk","flag":"Heard: a real duduk, in full spectrum (the A/B of 03.10 in «💎 Instrumental Probe LoRA»); its own adapter: loras/duduk-yt-r16."},{"slug":"low-wooden-flute","family":"winds-wood","family_name":"woodwinds","home":"everywhere","tag":"low wooden flute","en":"A breathy, dark, low flute of wood: air as much as tone.","ru":"Низкая деревянная флейта: тёмная, с густым дыханием, воздуха в ней не меньше, чем тона.","title":"Low Wooden Flute","flag":""},{"slug":"shofar","family":"winds-brass","family_name":"brass and horns","home":"Israel","tag":"shofar (ram's horn)","en":"A ram's horn blown with the lips: two raw notes, blasts and broken calls, no melody.","ru":"Бараний рог, дуют губами: две сырые ноты, протяжные и прерывистые сигналы, мелодии нет.","title":"Shofar (Ram's Horn)","flag":"Probed many times, without success: YuE2 does not know the shofar. The probes always give another pipe or horn, never a shofar, not even close. Its probes (below) are kept: take one as the horn or trumpet it turned out to be. Its adapter knows it: loras/shofar-yt-r16 at epoch 110, Viktor's ear: «Mind-blowing: no shofar player has heard the like. A whole meditation. One hundred percent a Yemenite shofar, an antelope horn two metres long» (167 overtrained, weak and thin; 66 undertrained, a trumpet in it).","failed":true},{"slug":"kinnor-lyre","family":"strings-plucked","family_name":"plucked strings","home":"ancient Israel","tag":"kinnor lyre","en":"David's lyre: few gut strings, bright, dry, sparse plucked chords.","ru":"Лира Давида: несколько жильных струн, светлый сухой звук, редкие щипковые аккорды.","title":"Kinnor Lyre","flag":""},{"slug":"harp","family":"strings-plucked","family_name":"plucked strings","home":"everywhere","tag":"harp","en":"Concert harp: rippling glissandi and bell-like notes with a long ring.","ru":"Концертная арфа: переливы глиссандо и колокольные ноты с долгим звоном.","title":"Harp","flag":""},{"slug":"psaltery","family":"strings-plucked","family_name":"plucked strings","home":"Near East, medieval Europe","tag":"psaltery","en":"A box of many plucked strings: shimmering, harp-like, close and metallic.","ru":"Ящик с множеством щипковых струн: мерцающий, близкий к арфе, но металличнее.","title":"Psaltery","flag":""},{"slug":"frame-drum","family":"perc-drum","family_name":"drums","home":"Near East","tag":"frame drum","en":"A wide hand drum on a wooden frame: deep boom and dry finger slaps.","ru":"Широкий ручной бубен на деревянном обруче: глубокий удар и сухие шлепки пальцами.","title":"Frame Drum","flag":""},{"slug":"tambourine","family":"perc-small","family_name":"small percussion","home":"everywhere","tag":"tambourine","en":"Small frame drum with jingles: shakes, rolls and bright metal clatter.","ru":"Бубен с тарелочками: тряска, тремоло и светлый металлический звон.","title":"Tambourine","flag":""},{"slug":"finger-cymbals","family":"perc-small","family_name":"small percussion","home":"Near East","tag":"finger cymbals","en":"Tiny cymbals struck between fingers: high, pure, ringing chimes.","ru":"Крошечные тарелочки на пальцах: высокий чистый звон.","title":"Finger Cymbals","flag":""},{"slug":"oud","family":"strings-plucked","family_name":"plucked strings","home":"Middle East","tag":"oud","en":"Fretless short-necked lute: woody, round, sliding 